+The local framework probe checked three case IDs. Its text-candidate transformation dispatched all three once, replayed all three on the second check and dispatched all three again for changed candidate bytes. With case 1 deliberately marked disagreeing, the same transformation rejected. This tests the manager and evidence memo; the population of GPU outcomes was tested separately on the actual device. [Framework probe](../scripts/03-contract-probe.mjs)
